{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOCTIS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOCTIS<strong>\u00a0</strong>is a single-player supernatural survival horror game where each level takes you deeper into the nightmarish realms of the dream world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After falling asleep, your struggle for survival begins. Can you wake up to reality, or will you be trapped forever in an endless nightmare? Progress through the game by solving puzzles, and uncover the truth behind the entity that haunts your dreams. Every completed level brings you one step closer to reality\u2026 or so you hope.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f Multiple Nightmare Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worlds inspired by different phobias and horror themes, where reality twists into a living nightmare. Each level drags you deeper into the unknown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Varied Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is simple \u2013 wake up. Do different tasks to break free from the nightmare\u2019s grip and escape\u2026 if you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Lurking Horrors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>not</strong> alone. Terrifying entity lurk in the shadows, watching, waiting. Run, hide, or face the horror head-on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleep\u2026 if you dare.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Into the Darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3583980/6c9515debe632268e725da9de5c7c7371723aed6.jpg"},{"name":"The Fear of Eyes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3583980/6c9515debe632268e725da9de5c7c7371723aed6.jpg"},{"name":"Lost in the Hallways","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3583980/6c9515debe632268e725da9de5c7c7371723aed6.jpg"},{"name":"Into the Backroom",